  "description": "Classical hypothesis tests for .NET at scipy.stats parity: Student and Welch t, Mann-Whitney U, Wilcoxon signed-rank, chi-square, Fisher exact, Kolmogorov-Smirnov, one-way ANOVA, Kruskal-Wallis, Shapiro-Wilk, and Bonferroni / Benjamini-Hochberg / Benjamini-Yekutieli corrections. Arrays in, statistic and p-value out. No model, no training loop, no dependencies.",
